+ * is true, assessmentSessionFlow.js has already deleted the session and
+ * handed off to processAssessmentData() — there is nothing left in
+ * SessionStore for an UNDO to act on, so treat it the same as any other
+ * post-completion command for a consistent error message.
+ *
+ * Never throws: an empty history (nothing captured yet this session, or
+ * MAX_HISTORY already exhausted) is reported back as a structured
+ * failure, same convention as submitReply()/submitBulkReply().
